    "name": "The Well's Blessing",
    "steam_appid": 3637250,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637250/extras/b9507c19154cde4407398595d229aac9.poster.avif?t=1755087243\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637250/extras/b9507c19154cde4407398595d229aac9.webm?t=1755087243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637250/extras/b9507c19154cde4407398595d229aac9.mp4?t=1755087243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Well's Blessing is a <strong>story-driven, first-person exploration and puzzle game</strong> in which three animal-like teenagers embark on an unexpected <strong>journey of self-discovery</strong>. As they wander through a <strong>cozy, retro-stylised open-world environment</strong> and take part in several long-forgotten rituals &quot;hidden&quot; in their surroundings, they begin to sense that <strong>the sanctuary may have a life of its own</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key aspects</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-ended exploration</strong> that externalizes the <strong>protagonists\u2019 inner discovery</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio-driven puzzles</strong> \u201chidden\u201d in the environment which are closely intertwined with the protagonists\u2019 development</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lighthearted yet introspective <strong>coming-of-age story</strong> that explores the contemporary tensions between <strong>tradition and modernity</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive soundtrack</strong> and <strong>stylised retro graphics</strong>\u00a0(+ cute animals)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637250/extras/f1d369afc3d2ac3c38a98ff0bce376e4.poster.avif?t=1755087243\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637250/extras/f1d369afc3d2ac3c38a98ff0bce376e4.webm?t=1755087243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637250/extras/f1d369afc3d2ac3c38a98ff0bce376e4.mp4?t=1755087243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a severe fire and a hurried restoration, <strong>the Old Well sanctuary finally reopens its doors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Home to the well whose water has long been linked to a series of superstitions about \u201c<strong>starting anew</strong>,\u201d the natural park\u2019s reopening draws all kinds of anthropomorphic animals who wish to turn their lives around... or simply take a pleasant stroll through nature, far from their daily worries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The grand opening unexpectedly reunites three teenagers who, despite once being quite close, lost touch after finishing compulsory secondary school. <strong>As they get to know each other better</strong> and <strong>reflect on where their lives are headed</strong>, they begin to sense that <strong>the sanctuary may have a life of its own</strong>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637250/extras/b9507c19154cde4407398595d229aac9.poster.avif?t=1755087243\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637250/extras/b9507c19154cde4407398595d229aac9.webm?t=1755087243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637250/extras/b9507c19154cde4407398595d229aac9.mp4?t=1755087243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Well's Blessing is a <strong>story-driven, first-person exploration and puzzle game</strong> in which three animal-like teenagers embark on an unexpected <strong>journey of self-discovery</strong>. As they wander through a <strong>cozy, retro-stylised open-world environment</strong> and take part in several long-forgotten rituals &quot;hidden&quot; in their surroundings, they begin to sense that <strong>the sanctuary may have a life of its own</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key aspects</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-ended exploration</strong> that externalizes the <strong>protagonists\u2019 inner discovery</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio-driven puzzles</strong> \u201chidden\u201d in the environment which are closely intertwined with the protagonists\u2019 development</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lighthearted yet introspective <strong>coming-of-age story</strong> that explores the contemporary tensions between <strong>tradition and modernity</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive soundtrack</strong> and <strong>stylised retro graphics</strong>\u00a0(+ cute animals)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637250/extras/f1d369afc3d2ac3c38a98ff0bce376e4.poster.avif?t=1755087243\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637250/extras/f1d369afc3d2ac3c38a98ff0bce376e4.webm?t=1755087243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637250/extras/f1d369afc3d2ac3c38a98ff0bce376e4.mp4?t=1755087243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a severe fire and a hurried restoration, <strong>the Old Well sanctuary finally reopens its doors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Home to the well whose water has long been linked to a series of superstitions about \u201c<strong>starting anew</strong>,\u201d the natural park\u2019s reopening draws all kinds of anthropomorphic animals who wish to turn their lives around... or simply take a pleasant stroll through nature, far from their daily worries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The grand opening unexpectedly reunites three teenagers who, despite once being quite close, lost touch after finishing compulsory secondary school. <strong>As they get to know each other better</strong> and <strong>reflect on where their lives are headed</strong>, they begin to sense that <strong>the sanctuary may have a life of its own</strong>.</p>",
    "short_description": "Explore the mystical sanctuary of the Old Well and reconnect with your childhood friends while solving audio-driven puzzles. Meet quirky animals, unravel forgotten tales and immerse yourself in an interactive soundscape as you piece together your place in the world.",
